	)
	(text "CHASSIS-MOUNTED. 135 A port: gPV 160 A 1000 V DC in each pole, derated 124 A (fuses in the INLET air path,\nPD3: terminals / fuse bases only, creepage to PE >= 16.0 mm IIIa, IC-18/IC-21)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 50.764 0)
		(effects
			(font
