	)
	(text "G7L-2A-X, poles in series, normal polarity = current 8 -> 2 (terminal -> bus). K_A_PRE feeds the coil\nand gates its IRFL214 low side; S2M + SMBJ33A across the coil (37-42 V, Omron p5). R_pre 220 ohm Miba\nRST 200 (RFQ, pulse-rated). Complete at |dV| <= 10 V after the VA/VAX null; abort below 0.8 x Vterm x\n(1-exp(-t/0.22 s)) or at 1.32 s; max 3 attempts, then 30 s lock-out (sim/port_design.py)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 230.164 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "534061d4-3dc0-5036-88af-96d3d49f15e6")
	)
	(text "TPSI3050 EN = K_DISCH OR FB_A_MAIN (2 x BAS16): powered = BSS138 holds the SiC gate low. Unpowered\n= the bus biases the gate (10 M, 15 V zener) -> 2 x 300 ohm Miba RST 200 discharge the bus. FB is high\nwhile the contactor is closed (or welded), so an E-stop or a lost K_DISCH cannot discharge a live port;\nFB keeps a running TPSI on, SYS energises K_DISCH first at power-up (27 mA start-up)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 295.44 245.344 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "540fa325-496d-5851-a20b-94f1a1508b1b")
	)
	(text "PRECHARGE RELAY + RESISTOR"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 167.064 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "55724155-3838-53cb-a7e4-9b8995f5276b")
	)
	(text "CSM2F-8518 100 uOhm, busbar-mounted. Kelvin test points to the IA/IB amplifier.\nPositive current = power into the module at this port. NTC on the shunt\n(reinforced pad) -> SYS-IO-AUX NTC input: firmware TCR compensation."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 153.448 199.324 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "58faf059-357d-5cd6-94e1-e638f8372265")
	)
	(text "DIS_G charges 1 uF through 4.7 M; a MMBT3906 compares it with DIS_G/2 (1 M / 1 M, also the gate pull-\ndown) and fires the MMBT3906/MMBT3904 latch: gate clamped to 0.75 V after 2.4-5.1 s (needed <= 1.8 s),\nheld by the bias current until K_DISCH returns (BSS138 resets it). Thermostat KSD301-class (closes 80 C) on an\nRST 200 housing fires the same latch; it is at HV - basic-insulating pad to the housing (PE)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14 335.414 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "64178697-b08c-54d3-aa4d-45f57f7edc0e")
	)
	(text "Channel 1: HOLD1 -> BSS138 -> IRFR9214 high side from the port +24V (not cut by E-stop) -> S2M -> coil+.\nChannel 2: IRFL214 low side coil- -> GND, gate fed from the channel-1 output (10 k / 22 k) and clamped\noff by a BSS138 unless HOLD2: it can only conduct while channel 1 conducts, so no flyback ever finds the\nSYS DO clamp. No single shorted switch energises the coil (report sec. 7.1 fault table)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 511.188 93.572 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "997910b5-99b0-5258-8382-071570eb728f")
	)
	(text "10 x 47 k 2512 1 W (100 V each at 1000 V): back-up discharge, 2.4 W at 1000 V.\nREDCUBE studs: bus +/- to the power cells, terminal-side tap."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 176.06 322.52 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "9b9b4910-5f15-5bf6-89ac-27025517ecc9")
	)
	(text "HVC43-250A-24MC, + pole, bidirectional (TDK p2). Opens at zero current in normal operation; cut-off\n450 A @ 1000 V once. K_A_MAIN feeds coil+ (S2M) AND gates the IRFL214 low side: two switches in the\npath. S10K30 directly across the coil = the only flyback path (>= 54 V down to drop-out; TDK p7 >= 50 V),\nV_DS <= 107 V. FB: NC mirror contact inverted by 1.5 k: FB_A_MAIN high = CLOSED (also feeds the TPSI EN OR).\nIC-05: coil + mirror contact to main >= 4400 V AC, Uimp 8 kV (HVC43MC p3): reinforced with the 6 kV credit\n(6.6 kV at 4000 m); insulation type not stated (TDK to confirm); coil/FB wiring >= 10 mm from the studs.\nPV-class port: no stiff source allowed (battery / DC bus = source battery)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 363.676 95.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b0aa6e8e-af11-5b88-b715-d8acc6315ce5")
	)
